  "description": "WHO SAYS THE BEST THINGS ARE OFF LIMITS.Our Launch Editions are where we raid the top shelf, and this DECOY X is no exception. Here, we've harnessed the industry's most sought-after tech and meshed it with the earth-moving power of the new Avinox M2S system.This E-MTB is illicitly fast, and only the best will do. We’ve equipped it with the FOX Podium fork – the plushest, most capable front end they've ever produced – and a premium DT Swiss wheelset with DF technology to neutralize pedal kickback. The result? Total composure on even the most brutal terrain, fueled by a level of torque, range, and speed never before felt on dirt.",
